---
layout: base.njk
title: What's on the big screens
ogTitle: "What's on at the Belle: football, rugby, F1, darts and more"
description: "Every big game across five London sports pubs: Premier League, Champions League, England rugby at Twickenham, F1, darts and boxing. Filter by sport or by your local and book a table."
og: sport
theme: night
permalink: /sport/
bodyClass: page-sport
---
<section class="sport-hero">
  <div class="sport-hero__floor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap sport-hero__inner sport-hero__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Sport at the Belle</p>
      <h1>Every big game, <span class="neon neon--flicker">sound on.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Football, rugby, NFL, F1, darts, boxing and plenty more, across five pubs with eighteen sound zones between them. Find the game, pick your Belle, book the table.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--rose" href="#board">See the fixtures</a>
        <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-book data-book-tab="party" data-occasion="Watch party">Host a watch party</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- set big = board.headlines[0] %}
    {%- if big %}
    <div class="bigscreen" data-upcoming>
      <div class="bigscreen__tv">
        <p class="bigscreen__label">Next big one</p>
        <p class="bigscreen__comp">{{ big.competition }}</p>
        <p class="bigscreen__title">{{ big.title }}</p>
        <p class="bigscreen__when">{{ big.date | dayLong }} · {{ big.time or "time TBC" }}{% if big.channel %} · {{ big.channel }}{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bigscreen__stand" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <button class="btn btn--rose" type="button" data-book data-fix="{{ big.id }}" data-date="{{ big.date }}">Book for this one</button>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="screens-strip">
      {%- for v in venues %}
      <a class="screen-stat" href="{{ ('/' + v.slug + '/') | u }}">
        <span class="screen-stat__logo">{% logo v.logo, v.name %}</span>
        <span class="screen-stat__num">{% if v.screens %}{{ v.screens }} <small>screens</small>{% else %}Multi <small>screen wall</small>{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="screen-stat__num">{{ v.soundZones }} <small>sound zones</small></span>
        {%- if v.games %}<span class="small muted">{{ v.games }}</span>{% endif %}
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="filters" id="board">
  <div class="wrap filters__rows">
    <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Sport">
      <button class="chip" type="button" data-filter-sport="all" aria-pressed="true">All sport <small>{{ board.items.length }}</small></button>
      {%- for s in board.sports %}
      <button class="chip" type="button" data-filter-sport="{{ s.key }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ s.label }} <small>{{ s.count }}</small></button>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Venue">
      <button class="chip" type="button" data-filter-venue="all" aria-pressed="true">All five</button>
      {%- for v in venues %}
      <button class="chip" type="button" data-filter-venue="{{ v.slug }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ v.areaShort }}</button>
      {%- endfor %}
      <button class="chip chip--toggle" type="button" data-filter-big aria-pressed="false">Big games only</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="wrap board" data-board>
  <p class="board__count" data-board-count aria-live="polite">{{ board.items.length }} fixtures</p>
  {%- for d in board.days %}
  <div class="board__day" data-day="{{ d.date }}">
    <h2>{{ d.date | dayLong }}</h2>
    <div class="board__list">
      {%- for f in d.items %}
      {% include "partials/ticket.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {%- endfor %}
  <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px"><button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-board-more hidden>Show later fixtures</button></p>
  <p class="board__empty" data-board-empty hidden>Nothing on that combination yet. Try another sport, or <a href="#board" data-filter-sport="all">show everything</a>.</p>
  <p class="sample-note" style="margin-top:40px">
    Fixtures, kick-off times and channels are real, from the published TV listings as of 17 October 2026, and the times are UK time.
    Which Belle shows what, and where the sound's on, is a <b>sample screen plan</b>: each pub would set its own.
    Our sports schedule can change with demand, so to avoid disappointment, give your Belle a call before you come.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Part of a sports team?</p>
      <h2>Bring the whole squad.</h2>
      <p>Host your watch party or social at any Belle, indoors or out. We'll put your game on a screen with the sound up, sort a tab and a platter, and if it's at the Moretown or Hammersmith, the darts boards are right there for half-time.</p>
      <button class="btn btn--rose" type="button" data-book data-book-tab="party" data-occasion="Watch party">Plan a watch party</button>
    </div>
    <div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio:16/10">{% img "moretown-pano", "The Moretown Belle's circular bar ringed with screens", "(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>
